00:32:29.051 --> 00:32:31.048
&lt;font color="#ffffff"&gt;Für Susan geht die Reise los.&lt;/font&gt;

00:32:31.690 --> 00:32:33.648
&lt;font color="#ffffff"&gt;Der Flug von Zürich&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font color="#ffffff"&gt;nach San Francisco,&lt;/font&gt;

00:32:34.292 --> 00:32:36.248
