00:32:44.170 --> 00:32:48.528
&lt;font color="#ffffff"&gt;* Instrumentalversion von "California&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;font color="#ffffff"&gt;Dreamin'" von The Mamas &amp; The Papas *&lt;/font&gt;

